WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.634
-We are in the Doombox.

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:06.067
Our next three songs will decide
tonight's champions.

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:09.200
It's time for
"Slay It Don't Spray It".

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.267
-♪ Better know the words
or you'll get sprayed ♪

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:15.701
-And here's how it works.

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:18.000
Players from each team will take
turns singing well-known songs

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.367
karaoke-style.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:20.534
They'll have the lyrics
in front of them,

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:22.000
but when the music drops out,

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.868
they'll have to finish
the line from memory.

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:25.901
If they don't get the lyrics
exactly right,

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:29.467
the microphones in front of them
will spray water in their face.

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:31.868
But if they can slay it and sing
all of the words perfectly,

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:33.834
then their opponents get
drenched instead.

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:36.567
Each song is worth
50,000 points.

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:38.200
All right.
-All right.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.934
-Nicole and Jason, your team
is up first.

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:43.000
Let's see what song you get.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.601 --> 00:00:48.734
-That's a good one.

00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:51.000
-"Rolling in the Deep", Adele.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.100
-Uh-oh.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.133
-You have to decide
who's gonna sing.

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.133
-I like this song.

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:55.634
I think -- I like this song.

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:56.801
-Yeah, you like this?

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:57.901
I'll take that as,
"I'm singing the song."

00:00:57.901 --> 00:00:59.200
-You got us, you got us.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.901
-Really?
-How much water is coming out?

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:02.400
-Are you guys nervous?
-Yes.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.434
-Yeah.
-Yeah, I know.

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:04.634
Me, too, a little bit.
Yeah, all right.

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:06.634
Whenever you're ready,
go for it.

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:09.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:10.567
-Oh, my God.
-Don't cry.

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:29.934
-It's gonna happen, right?

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:36.634
-♪ And you played it, what,
to the beat, yeah ♪

00:01:36.634 --> 00:01:38.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.801
[ Both scream ]

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.734
I'm sorry! Guys --

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:44.334
-It's more water than I thought.

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:45.701
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:46.968
-Jason knew he was gonna be dry.

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:48.067
-I knew I was good.
-Jason's, like, dancing

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:49.067
in there.
He's like, "I know

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.200
I'm gonna be dry."
-Yeah.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:53.300
-Oh, you knew it was coming out
here.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:56.100
[ Both scream ]

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.367
-So much spray.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:58.734
-It is so cold.

00:01:58.734 --> 00:01:59.834
-Ooh, sorry about that.

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:02.100
-Oh, my gosh, I'm scared.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.300
-All right. Julie and Kelsea,
it is your turn.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.534
Let's see what song you get.

00:02:07.267 --> 00:02:10.400
[ Crowd cheering ]

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.601
-"Man! I Feel Like a Woman!",
Shania Twain.

00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:15.367
-Whoo! Let's go!

00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:17.000
-I feel like it's
a Kelsea Ballerini song.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.033
-I would be nervous,
I would be nervous.

00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:19.234
-Pressure's on.

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:20.701
-I don't want you to walk away
from the mics.

00:02:20.701 --> 00:02:21.701
-I want to be right here.

00:02:21.701 --> 00:02:23.033
-Right like this, Jimmy.

00:02:23.033 --> 00:02:25.968
-Whenever you're ready.

00:02:25.968 --> 00:02:27.167
-Let's do it.

00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:29.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:30.467
-Here we go.

00:02:43.434 --> 00:02:45.734
-I'm gonna go for it.

00:02:45.734 --> 00:02:47.133
I know we're gonna get squirted,
Jason.

00:03:01.067 --> 00:03:02.767
-I know what's about to happen.

00:03:03.968 --> 00:03:07.367
-♪ To feel the way I feel ♪

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:12.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.167
-I did it.
-I --

00:03:13.167 --> 00:03:14.300
-You knew it.
-I knew it was coming.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.400
-You knew it, you felt it.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.434
-I committed.
-Really?

00:03:16.434 --> 00:03:18.767
-Look at my face.

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:19.801
-So proud of you guys.

00:03:19.801 --> 00:03:21.667
-Jimmy, my face is gone.

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.968
-You did a good job.
-I'm so sorry.

00:03:23.968 --> 00:03:27.067
-That's 50,000 points
for your team.

00:03:27.067 --> 00:03:31.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:31.234 --> 00:03:32.801
-We decided to just commit.

00:03:32.801 --> 00:03:34.467
-It is time for the final round.

00:03:34.467 --> 00:03:36.300
And this time, we're really
gonna raise the stakes

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:37.334
in this one.

00:03:37.334 --> 00:03:38.400
Watch your heads
because we're bringing in

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:39.601
the big microphones.

00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:41.334
Come on in, guys.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:41.334 --> 00:03:43.434
-Season two upgrades coming in.

00:03:43.434 --> 00:03:45.467
-Jimmy, I'm soaking wet
right now.

00:03:45.467 --> 00:03:47.067
-Hope you brought a towel.
[ Laughs ]

00:03:47.067 --> 00:03:48.400
-Jimmy, is this more water?

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.801
-The four of you
are going to take turns singing.

00:03:50.801 --> 00:03:53.534
And this round is worth
200,000 points.

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:54.534
So whoever wins this...
-200,000.

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:57.033
-...wins the whole thing.

00:03:57.033 --> 00:03:59.300
Let's see what
our final song is.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:03.367
[ Cheers and applause ]
-I'm so wet.

00:04:04.567 --> 00:04:06.133
[ Cheers and applause ]
-"I Kissed A Girl",

00:04:06.133 --> 00:04:07.133
Katy Perry.

00:04:07.133 --> 00:04:08.167
-All right.
-Okay.

00:04:08.167 --> 00:04:10.901
-Nicole, you're going
to start us off.

00:04:10.901 --> 00:04:12.868
-I'm soaking wet.

00:04:12.868 --> 00:04:15.334
♪♪

00:04:59.968 --> 00:05:03.801
-♪ It felt so right,
it felt so right ♪

00:05:05.367 --> 00:05:06.534
-♪ In love ♪

00:05:06.534 --> 00:05:08.667
-[ Laughs ]
-[ Crowd ] Oh!

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:10.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.434
-Oh.
-They got it.

00:05:12.434 --> 00:05:14.834
-It felt so right,
but it was so wrong.

00:05:14.834 --> 00:05:21.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:21.801 --> 00:05:23.234
-We have a winner!

00:05:23.234 --> 00:05:26.734
Julia, Kelsea are tonight's
"That's My Jam" champions!

00:05:26.734 --> 00:05:28.334
Get out here!

00:05:28.334 --> 00:05:29.901
-Whoo!

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:31.334
-There's your Boombox.

00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:33.834
-Yeah!
-There's your golden Boombox.

00:05:33.834 --> 00:05:35.601
-You are the champs.
Nicole, come on.

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:37.567
I'm -- Oh, my God.

00:05:37.567 --> 00:05:39.267
Oh, my God.

00:05:39.267 --> 00:05:42.133
-Do we get points
for being soaking wet?

